      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782482244916,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nSemantic (Ollama) — uses LLM:\n- \"Summarize the TotalEnergies contract\"\n- \"What are the payment terms?\"\n- \"Explain the conditions in the agreement\"\n- \"Describe the inventory levels from 2016\"\n- \"Overview of all shipping orders\"\n- \"Tell me about the supplier responsibilities\"\n- \"What does the contract say about delivery timelines?\"\n- \"What about the vendor agreements?\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nSemantic (Ollama) — uses LLM:\n- \"Summarize the TotalEnergies contract\"\n- \"What are the payment terms?\"\n- \"Explain the conditions in the agreement\"\n- \"Describe the inventory levels from 2016\"\n- \"Overview of all shipping orders\"\n- \"Tell me about the supplier responsibilities\"\n- \"What does the contract say about delivery timelines?\"\n- \"What about the vendor agreements?\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "iaQmLshW-9gxTW3nZ2VqW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -222.92478151825242,
      "y": 3865.6702760222115,
      "width": 448.84841114962273,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 626498142,
      "version": 177,
      "versionNonce": 1132748738,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782482248199,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Structured (SQL) — no Ollama:\n- \"Which invoices are missing a purchase order?\"\n- \"List all invoices for Roland Mendel\"\n- \"Show me purchase order 10711\"\n- \"How many invoices do we have?\"\n- \"What is the total amount for order 10603?\"\n- \"Find the vendor named Harris-Green\"\n- \"Count invoices without a PO number\"\n- \"What is the highest invoice amount?\"\n- \"Find all shipments for order 10687\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Structured (SQL) — no Ollama:\n- \"Which invoices are missing a purchase order?\"\n- \"List all invoices for Roland Mendel\"\n- \"Show me purchase order 10711\"\n- \"How many invoices do we have?\"\n- \"What is the total amount for order 10603?\"\n- \"Find the vendor named Harris-Green\"\n- \"Count invoices without a PO number\"\n- \"What is the highest invoice amount?\"\n- \"Find all shipments for order 10687\"",
